# API Contracts

Source of truth: `server/src/routes/`. Update server route, `client/src/constants/apiEndpoints.js`, and relevant `*Api.js` / hook in the same change.

## Canonical Routes

| Area | Method | Path | Notes |
|------|--------|------|-------|
| List blogs | GET | `/api/blog/all` | Published blogs only |
| Blog detail | GET | `/api/blog/:blogId` | |
| Add comment | POST | `/api/blog/add-comment` | body: `{ blog, name, content }` |
| Get comments | POST | `/api/blog/comments` | body: `{ blogId }` |
| Create blog | POST | `/api/blog/add` | multipart: `blog` JSON + `image` file |
| Delete blog | POST | `/api/blog/delete` | body: `{ id }` |
| Publish | POST | `/api/blog/publish` | body: `{ id }` |
| Unpublish | POST | `/api/blog/unpublish` | body: `{ id }` |
| AI generate | POST | `/api/blog/generate` | body: `{ prompt }` |
| Admin login | POST | `/api/admin/login` | body: `{ email, password }` |
| Admin dashboard | GET | `/api/admin/dashboard` | not `/stats` |
| Admin blogs | GET | `/api/admin/blogs` | |
| Admin comments | GET | `/api/admin/comments` | |
| Approve comment | POST | `/api/admin/approve-comment` | body: `{ id }` |
| Unapprove comment | POST | `/api/admin/unapprove-comment` | body: `{ id }` |
| Delete comment | POST | `/api/admin/delete-comment` | body: `{ id }` |
| Static images | GET | `/uploads/blogs/:filename` | |

## Response Shape

```javascript
{ success: true, count?: number, blogs?: [], comments?: [], message?: string, token?: string }
{ success: false, message: string }
```

## Do Not

- Use PUT/DELETE client paths unless a matching server route exists
- Invent REST-style paths (`/api/blog/:id` with PUT) — mutations use POST
- Change an endpoint on one side without updating the other
